<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Creditanstalt makes profit in 96.</title>
<headline>Slovak Creditanstalt makes profit in 96.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creditanstalt a.s., a the Slovak unit of Austrian bank Creditanstalt Bankverein, said on Wednesday it posted a 93.2 million crown net profit in 1996, after a loss of 70.1 million in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;We consider the results from the second year (1996) of Creditanstalt's operations in Bratislava as excellent,&quot; company spokeswoman Svetlana Liskova said.</p>
</text>
